18","surface":"鄭攀","start":518,"end":520,"person_id":"200_oqy_d7c","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0529","surface":"硃伺","start":529,"end":531,"person_id":"zx9_13u_h08","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0544","surface":"張奕","start":544,"end":546,"person_id":"9u8_20z_zdq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0601","surface":"硃伺","start":601,"end":603,"person_id":"zx9_13u_h08","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0611","surface":"張奕","start":611,"end":613,"person_id":"9u8_20z_zdq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0623","surface":"王敦","start":623,"end":625,"person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taoyu:p001","text":"臻弟輿，果烈善戰，以功累遷武威將軍。初，賊張奕本中州人，元康中被差西征，遇天下亂，遂留蜀。至是，率三百餘家欲就杜弢，為侃所獲。諸將請殺其丁壯，取其妻息，輿曰：「此本官兵，數經戰陣，可赦之以為用。」侃赦之，以配輿。及侃與杜弢戰敗，賊以桔槔打沒官軍船艦，軍中失色。輿率輕舸出其上流以擊之，所向輒克。賊又率眾將焚侃輜重，輿又擊破之。自是每戰輒克，賊望見輿軍，相謂曰：「避陶武威。」無敢當者。後與杜弢戰，輿被重創，卒。侃哭之慟，曰：「喪吾家寶！」三軍皆為之垂泣。詔贈長沙太守。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":94,"last_line":94,"raw_start":10182,"raw_end":10418,"raw_character_offsets":[10184,10185,10186,10187,10188,10189,10190,10191,10192,10193,10194,10195,10196,10197,10198,10199,10200,10201,10202,10203,10204,10205,10206,10207,10208,10209,10210,10211,10212,10213,10214,10215,10216,10217,10218,10219,10220,10221,10222,10223,10224,10225,10226,10227,10228,10229,10230,10231,10232,10233,10234,10235,10236,10237,10238,10239,10240,10241,10242,10243,10244,10245,10246,10247,10248,10249,10250,10251,10252,10253,10254,10255,10256,10257,10258,10259,10260,10261,10262,10263,10264,10265,10266,10267,10268,10269,10270,10271,10272,10273,10